# Taris, the Undercity (K1, tar_m04aa) to the Lower Sewers: the elevator's
# thugs and Shaleena, Hendar at the gate (out to kill the rakghoul hunting
# him), Mission outside the gate (she joins), the sewers' door. Starts from
# the Lower City route's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @undercity data/routes/k1/taris_undercity.route --god
talk                     # the elevator's toll thugs, then Shaleena
save undercity_in
to tar04_maingate        # Hendar runs for the gate (tar04_outwom043):
talk                     # "open the gate, I will kill the rakghouls"
to ta04_closegate        # out through the gate, as the scene runs the party:
                         # it closes behind them, and the rakghoul comes
fight 20                 # the rakghoul on his heels (HendarsFate)
save hendar
gone hendarsfate         # its body taken away: Mission's trigger
                         # (k_ptar_miscrt_en) does nothing while it is there
to tar04_spmission       # out of the trigger and in again (tar04_miscrt):
to tar04_miscrt          # Mission, her Wookiee taken by Gamorreans
until Tar_Mission=30     # (tar04_mission: she joins; on the way out already
                         # when the fight left the party beyond her trigger)
save mission
exit TarisDoor3          # down into the Lower Sewers
save lower_sewers
